Day 4/60 — I asked Claude to build me a personalized career roadmap. Here's what happened. 🗺️
Most people Google "how to become a Data Scientist" and get lost in a sea of courses.
I gave Claude 4 inputs:
→ My current situation
→ My existing skills
→ My target goal
→ My timeline
And it built me a full, structured roadmap in seconds.
Not a generic template.
A personalized, chain-of-thought breakdown with:
✅ Skill gap analysis (what I have vs what I need)
📚 Priority learning plan — month by month
💼 5 portfolio projects to build
📅 6 monthly milestones to hit
🌐 Networking strategy (LinkedIn, Kaggle, cold DMs)
⚡ Immediate next actions — starting this week
And then I asked it to export the whole thing as a clean, one-page PDF.
Done in under 2 minutes.
This is what AI fluency looks like in practice — not just chatting with AI, but using it as a thinking partner that works WITH your goals.
🔖 Save this if you're planning a career move.
